      "With the paper finished, she and the coach look back over the activity log, the research framework, the proposal and the final draft, and she writes her own review first. The system then generates the nine-section report: counted facts, plus judgments that each open onto the record behind them.",
    ],
    href: "/product/evaluation",
    asset: "walk-06-report",
    shot: "product/evaluation-report-v1.webp",
